description:
infra-agent has shipped terraform/modules/ecr (closed by awsk-ux9.3). Lead, please wire it into terraform/main.tf root composition with the following block (and add module.ecr.repository_uris / repository_arns passthroughs to terraform/outputs.tf as the CI publish workflow + Helm values consumers will need them):

terraform/main.tf:
module "ecr" {
  source     = "./modules/ecr"
  repo_names = var.ecr_repo_names
  tags       = local.tags
}

terraform/variables.tf:
variable "ecr_repo_names" {
  description = "ECR repository names to provision. Default covers the two app images shipped by this branch."
  type        = list(string)
  default     = ["connect-web", "connect-worker"]
}

terraform/outputs.tf:
output "ecr_repository_uris" {
  description = "Map of ECR repo name -> repository URI. Consumed by the CI publish workflow and Helm image.repository values."
  value       = module.ecr.repository_uris
}

output "ecr_repository_arns" {
  description = "Map of ECR repo name -> repository ARN. Used by IAM policy that grants pull/push permissions."
  value       = module.ecr.repository_arns
}

Module README at terraform/modules/ecr/README.md documents inputs/outputs/lifecycle policy. fmt + validate already clean; ministack ECR plan also passes (apply path cannot be exercised here -- ministack 'light' edition does not expose ECR).
